// UIX mugshot compatibility.
//
// STATUS: fallback only.  The Unholy UIXTEAM shadow (uixteam.acs) resolves a
// mugshot through the shared UHDT presentation resolver first
// (uh_GetTeamPortraitForTid -> UH_PlayerPortrait), so these scripts are only
// reached when that resolver has no row for the class.  They are deliberately
// NOT deleted:
//   * this pk3's UIXTEAM shadow only wins when UIX loads BEFORE it; with the
//     opposite load order the stock v3bh UIXTEAM calls
//     getMugshotGraphicFromTID directly, and these scripts are then the only
//     path that gives an Unholy class a face;
//   * they keep working for any other mod's PBMug_<Class> scripts.
// Every script below has a matching DefineTeamPresentation row, so the two can
// never disagree about a built-in class (tools/check_team_presentation.py
// asserts this).  Do not add a row here for a new class — register it with
// DefineTeamPresentation instead (see the recipe in _includes/mod_api/uhadd.acs).
//
// Each registered survivor returns its UMUG_<id> texture, defined with
// XScale/YScale 4.0 in TEXTURES.classes.faces so UIX draws it at the
// 8x8 logical size its skull effect layer (UXMGSKIE) expects. IDs are
// the KEYCONF addplayerclass order.

script "PBMug_MegaManU" (int tid) {SetResultValue("UMUG_0");}
script "PBMug_Qwant" (int tid) {SetResultValue("UMUG_1");}
script "PBMug_NegaMan" (int tid) {SetResultValue("UMUG_2");}
